  "interauralDistance and dopplerEnabled are held, Web Audio has no use for them",
  "the 4.0 UOM gives ListenerPointSource gain, mediaDeviceID and a start/stop clock; X_ITE 16.6.0 has none of them, so they are held here and not compared"
